<title>UK: Den Norske sets 500 million mark seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Den Norske sets 500 million mark seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEN NORSKE USA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    22.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    22.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  ISS PRICE  100.045   FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMS US/GB/DE/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
